201
00:15:11,790 --> 00:15:13,790
Boa noite, luvas.

202
00:15:15,790 --> 00:15:18,630
Boa noite, casinha.

203
00:15:18,800 --> 00:15:21,130
E boa noite, rato.

204
00:15:23,040 --> 00:15:24,200
Boa noite, escadas.

205
